  "result": "Based on my analysis of the codebase, when a new member is added to the shared `ErrorCode` union that every Server Action returns, the following files must be updated:\n\n**Source files:**\n- `src/types/api.ts` — defines the `ErrorCode` union\n- `src/lib/errors.ts` — maps each error code to an HTTP status in `HTTP_STATUS_BY_CODE`\n- `tests/lib/errors.test.ts` — tests that error codes are covered\n\n**Documentation files:**\n- `docs/glossary.md` — documents all error codes in the \"Errors\" section (lines 242–260)\n- `docs/adr/ADR-014-domain-errors-to-error-codes.md` — architecture decision record that lists and explains all error codes\n- `docs/design/action-wrapper-and-errors.md` — design document that describes the error mapping architecture and lists action error classes\n\nOptional:\n- `src/actions/_lib/action-errors.ts` — if the new error code corresponds to an action-layer error class\n\nANSWER: src/types/api.ts, src/lib/errors.ts, tests/lib/errors.test.ts, docs/glossary.md, docs/adr/ADR-014-domain-errors-to-error-codes.md, docs/design/action-wrapper-and-errors.md",
